# ZoomShop REST API — example requests (HTTPie / curl)
# Base URL (adjust host/port): http://127.0.0.1:8000
# Versioning: add query parameter version=1 (default if omitted for many clients).

### JWT: obtain access + refresh (auth remains under /api/v1/auth/)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/jwt/create/
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "staff@example.com", "password": "your-password"}

### Products: paginated list (anonymous), search + ordering + version
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/products/?version=1&search=kibble&ordering=name&page=1&page_size=10

### Products: filter by category + active flag
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/products/?version=1&category=<CATEGORY_UUID>&is_active=true

### Categories: list with filters
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/categories/?version=1&name=dog

### Product detail
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/products/<PRODUCT_UUID>/?version=1

### Product create (staff / manage_products / full_access) — Bearer JWT required
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/products/?version=1
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cat toy",
  "sku": "TOY-001",
  "category": "<CATEGORY_UUID>",
  "description": "",
  "base_price": "9.99",
  "age_restriction": 0,
  "is_active": true,
  "initial_stock": 12
}

### Orders: list (requires users.view_sales or staff / full_access)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/orders/?version=1&ordering=-ordered_at
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>

### Reviews: public list
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/reviews/?version=1

### Promo codes: public list (active-only for anonymous)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/promocodes/?version=1&is_active=true

### News: public list (published-only for anonymous)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/news/?version=1&is_published=true

### OpenAPI schema + Swagger UI
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/schema/
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/docs/

### Equivalent curl (JWT + products list)
# curl -s "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/products/?version=1" | jq .
# curl -s -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/orders/?version=1" | jq .
